their product. No third-party source files or assets are included.

In this published copy the robot's name was replaced by "demo" in the test
fixture and tests. Paths written as skills/... refer to the private
workspace this folder came from.

Not standalone. The movement check needs the vector_slam_maze package
(vector-slam-maze v0.4.1), and the tests also read three Cartographer
scripts (_cartographer_lib.sh, draft-cartographer-vector-proprio.sh,
_vector_drive.py). None of those is published here. With them beside this
folder as skills/vector-slam and skills/, 36 of 36 tests pass; without them
20 of 36 pass and 16 fail.
